#: 2b99478e7f1f48eeb1910beb0297df39
msgid "If all is working, vision position estimates should begin flowing in from ROS to ArduPilot.  This can be confirmed by connecting to the flight controller using the Mission Planner (or similar) and check the Flight Data screen's Messages tab (bottom left) for messages from the EKF like below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:297
#: d390f2be861d43efaf9bd280c485f175
msgid "Using the Mission Planner (or similar) go to the Flight Data screen and right-mouse-button click on the map and select \"Set Home Here\" >> \"Set EKF Origin\".  The vehicle should appear immediately on the map where you clicked."
msgstr ""

